 : array-like of shape (n_elements,)\n2592 |         The sequence to be converted.\n2593 | \n2594 |     Returns\n2595 |     -------\n2596 |     out : ndarray of shape (n_elements,), dtype=object\n2597 |         The converted sequence into a 1-D NumPy array of object dtype.\n2598 | \n2599 |     Examples\n2600 |     --------\n2601 |     >>> import numpy as np\n2602 |     >>> from sklearn.utils.validation import _to_object_array\n2603 |     >>> _to_object_array([np.array([0]), np.array([1])])\n2604 |     array([array([0]), array([1])], dtype=object)\n2605 |     >>> _to_object_array([np.array([0]), np.array([1, 2])])\n2606 |     array([array([0]), array([1, 2])], dtype=object)\n2607 |     >>> _to_object_array([np.array([0]), np.array([1, 2])])\n2608 |     array([array([0]), array([1, 2])], dtype=object)\n2609 |     \"\"\"\n2610 |     out = np.empty(len(sequence), dtype=object)\n2611 |     out[:] = sequence\n2612 |     return out\n```\n\nFound function `doc/conftest.py:setup_compose`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n58 | def setup_compose():\n59 |     try:\n60 |         import pandas  # noqa\n61 |     except ImportError:\n62 |         raise SkipTest(\"Skipping compose.rst, pandas not installed\")\n```\n\nFound function `sklearn/cross_decomposition/_pls.py:_pinv2_old`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n41 | def _pinv2_old(a):\n42 |     # Used previous scipy pinv2 that was updated in:\n43 |     # https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/10067\n44 |     # We can not set `cond` or `rcond` for pinv2 in scipy >= 1.3 to keep the\n45 |     # same behavior of pinv2 for scipy < 1.3, because the condition used to\n46 |     # determine the rank is dependent on the output of svd.\n47 |     u, s, vh = svd(a, full_matrices=False, check_finite=False)\n48 | \n49 |     t = u.dtype.char.lower()\n50 |     factor = {\"f\": 1e3, \"d\": 1e6}\n51 |     cond = np.max(s) * factor[t] * np.finfo(t).eps\n52 |     rank = np.sum(s > cond)\n53 | 