(decimals=decimals)\n2505 |         return self._constructor_from_mgr(new_mgr, axes=new_mgr.axes).__finalize__(\n2506 |             self, method=\"round\"\n2507 |         )\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/core/frame.py:DataFrame.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/accessor.py:Accessor.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/base.py:Index.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/internals/blocks.py:Block.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/datetimes.py:DatetimeArray.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/datetimelike.py:TimelikeOps.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/masked.py:BaseMaskedArray.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/arrow/array.py:ArrowExtensionArray.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/period.py:PeriodArray.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/integer.py:IntegerArray.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use mor